      "independent_reason": "The first support equation is an equality in M_ijk, while the second is an equality in the codomain M_j tensor_(A_j,s) B_ijk of alpha on W_ijk. The existing prose incorrectly assigns M_ijk to both. The proposed respectively clause restores both types in their displayed order. Current line 3536/pinned 3245 independently names the same two ambient modules.",
      "nearby_registered_unit": "MC-STK-ERR-1505 starts at pinned 3215, immediately after the new operation at 3214, but its source interval does not overlap this operation and repairs a different statement.",
      "coupling": "The cover-orientation correction supplies the maps used in the second ambient tensor product. The two repairs are complementary, not duplicates.",
      "confidence": "high",
      "confidence_reason": "Direct comparison of the displayed equation types and the later explicit two-module sentence."
    },
    {
      "local_name": "groupoid-module-inverse-composition-order",
      "verdict": "VALID_NOT_DUPLICATE",
