      "independent_reason": "The cocycle reads pr_1*alpha composed with pr_0*alpha = c*alpha. Pullback along (i,1) gives alpha composed with i*alpha = s*e*alpha, because c(i,1)=e s. Pullback along (1,i) gives i*alpha composed with alpha = t*e*alpha. Both existing left-hand compositions are reversed. The two proposed changes preserve the named pullback maps and right-hand sides and type each identity on the proper pullback of F.",
